{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/06.-formulir-dan-kontrol-input","title":"06. Formulir dan Kontrol Input","slug":"06. formulir dan kontrol input","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma/06. Formulir dan Kontrol Input.md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Hirarki Dasar Elemen Form","id":"1-hirarki-dasar-elemen-form"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Input dengan Ikon Penyerta (`has-icons-left` / `has-icons-right`)","id":"2-input-dengan-ikon-penyerta-has-icons-left-has-icons-right"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Input Bergandeng dengan Tombol atau Awalan (`has-addons`)","id":"3-input-bergandeng-dengan-tombol-atau-awalan-has-addons"},{"depth":3,"text":"Contoh A: Kotak Pencarian Terpadu","id":"contoh-a-kotak-pencarian-terpadu"},{"depth":3,"text":"Contoh B: Input dengan Prefiks Statis","id":"contoh-b-input-dengan-prefiks-statis"},{"depth":2,"text":"4. Dropdown Pemilihan (`.select`) dan Area Teks (`.textarea`)","id":"4-dropdown-pemilihan-select-dan-area-teks-textarea"},{"depth":3,"text":"Dropdown Seleksi","id":"dropdown-seleksi"},{"depth":3,"text":"Area Teks Multibaris","id":"area-teks-multibaris"},{"depth":2,"text":"5. Kotak Centang (Checkbox) dan Radio Button","id":"5-kotak-centang-checkbox-dan-radio-button"},{"depth":2,"text":"6. Formulir Horizontal (`is-horizontal`)","id":"6-formulir-horizontal-is-horizontal"}],"content":"#programming \n\nBulma menyediakan arsitektur formulir yang sangat terstruktur, semantik, dan modular. Kunci penguasaan formulir Bulma terletak pada pemahaman hirarki pembungkus: `.field` > `.label` > `.control` > elemen input.\n\n## 1. Hirarki Dasar Elemen Form\n\nSetiap satu baris input umumnya dibungkus dalam struktur 4 tingkatan berikut:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <!-- 1. Label Teks -->\n  <label class=\"label\">Nama Lengkap</label>\n  \n  <!-- 2. Pembungkus Kontrol -->\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <!-- 3. Elemen Input Aktual -->\n    <input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Masukkan nama Anda\">\n  </div>\n  \n  <!-- 4. Pesan Bantuan atau Pesan Error -->\n  <p class=\"help\">Gunakan nama resmi yang sesuai dengan identitas KTP.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 2. Input dengan Ikon Penyerta (`has-icons-left` / `has-icons-right`)\n\nUntuk menempatkan ikon di dalam kotak input secara presisi, tambahkan modifier `has-icons-left` atau `has-icons-right` pada elemen `.control`, lalu sertakan elemen `<span class=\"icon is-small is-left\">`:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"label\">Alamat Email</label>\n  <div class=\"control has-icons-left has-icons-right\">\n    <input class=\"input is-success\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"nama@domain.com\" value=\"aryanda@example.com\">\n    <!-- Ikon Sisi Kiri -->\n    <span class=\"icon is-small is-left\">\n      <i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i>\n    </span>\n    <!-- Ikon Indikator Keberhasilan di Sisi Kanan -->\n    <span class=\"icon is-small is-right\">\n      <i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"help is-success\">Email ini tersedia dan valid.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 3. Input Bergandeng dengan Tombol atau Awalan (`has-addons`)\n\nKetika Anda ingin menyatukan input teks dengan tombol pencarian, atau menyematkan awalan domain (prefix) tanpa celah pemisah, gunakan modifier `has-addons` pada pembungkus `.field`:\n\n### Contoh A: Kotak Pencarian Terpadu\n```html\n<div class=\"field has-addons\">\n  <div class=\"control is-expanded\">\n    <input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Cari dokumentasi atau modul...\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <button class=\"button is-primary\">\n      <span class=\"icon is-small\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i></span>\n      <span>Cari</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n> [!TIP] Utilitas `is-expanded`\n> Modifier `is-expanded` pada elemen `.control` membuat input secara otomatis meregang mengisi seluruh sisa ruang horizontal yang tersedia sebelum tombol.\n\n### Contoh B: Input dengan Prefiks Statis\n```html\n<div class=\"field has-addons\">\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <a class=\"button is-static\">https://</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"control is-expanded\">\n    <input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"domain-pilihan-anda.com\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 4. Dropdown Pemilihan (`.select`) dan Area Teks (`.textarea`)\n\n### Dropdown Seleksi\nTag `<select>` harus dibungkus dalam wadah `<div class=\"select\">`:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"label\">Pilih Paket Layanan</label>\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <div class=\"select is-fullwidth\">\n      <select>\n        <option>Pilih salah satu paket</option>\n        <option>Paket Dasar (Gratis)</option>\n        <option>Paket Profesional (Bulanan)</option>\n        <option>Paket Korporat (Tahunan)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Area Teks Multibaris\n```html\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"label\">Catatan Tambahan</label>\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <textarea class=\"textarea\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Tulis instruksi pengiriman khusus di sini...\"></textarea>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 5. Kotak Centang (Checkbox) dan Radio Button\n\nBulma menata tag `<label class=\"checkbox\">` dan `<label class=\"radio\">` agar rapi dan sejajar:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <label class=\"checkbox\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\"> Saya telah membaca dan menyetujui syarat & ketentuan layanan.\n    </label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <div class=\"control\">\n    <label class=\"radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pembayaran\" checked> Transfer Bank\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pembayaran\"> Kartu Kredit\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pembayaran\"> Dompet Digital (E-Wallet)\n    </label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 6. Formulir Horizontal (`is-horizontal`)\n\nUntuk tata letak formulir klasik di mana label berada di sebelah kiri dan kotak input berada di sebelah kanan pada layar desktop:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"field is-horizontal\">\n  <div class=\"field-label is-normal\">\n    <label class=\"label\">Nama Organisasi</label>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field-body\">\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <div class=\"control\">\n        <input class=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: PT Teknologi Terbuka\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\nLanjutkan pembelajaran ke penataan kerangka halaman: [07. Tata Letak Panggung (Hero, Section, dan Container)](07.%20Tata%20Letak%20Panggung%20(Hero,%20Section,%20dan%20Container).md).\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:b6d13e8fcfaa0ba3b3a120ab54b998373346d2b2c4795a6872423175b7b7f0f4","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma/06. Formulir dan Kontrol Input","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Bulma"],"links":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/07.-tata-letak-panggung-(hero,-section,-dan-container)","title":"07. Tata Letak Panggung (Hero, Section, dan Container)","href":"/docs/pemrograman/css/bulma/07.-tata-letak-panggung-(hero,-section,-dan-container)"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/04_bulma-css","title":"04_Bulma CSS"},{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/05.-elemen-ui-inti-(buttons,-tags,-boxes,-dan-notifications)","title":"05. Elemen UI Inti (Buttons, Tags, Boxes, dan Notifications)"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Bulma menyediakan arsitektur formulir yang sangat terstruktur, semantik, dan modular. Kunci penguasaan formulir Bulma terletak pada pemahaman hirarki pembungkus: <code>.field</code> > <code>.label</code> > <code>.control</code> > elemen input.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-hirarki-dasar-elemen-form\">1. Hirarki Dasar Elemen Form</h2>\n<p>Setiap satu baris input umumnya dibungkus dalam struktur 4 tingkatan berikut:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- 1. Label Teks --></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Nama Lengkap<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- 2. Pembungkus Kontrol --></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- 3. Elemen Input Aktual --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Masukkan nama Anda\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- 4. Pesan Bantuan atau Pesan Error --></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"help\"</span>></span>Gunakan nama resmi yang sesuai dengan identitas KTP.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-input-dengan-ikon-penyerta-has-icons-left-has-icons-right\">2. Input dengan Ikon Penyerta (<code>has-icons-left</code> / <code>has-icons-right</code>)</h2>\n<p>Untuk menempatkan ikon di dalam kotak input secara presisi, tambahkan modifier <code>has-icons-left</code> atau <code>has-icons-right</code> pada elemen <code>.control</code>, lalu sertakan elemen <code>&#x3C;span class=\"icon is-small is-left\"></code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Alamat Email<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control has-icons-left has-icons-right\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input is-success\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"email\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama@domain.com\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"aryanda@example.com\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Ikon Sisi Kiri --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"icon is-small is-left\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"fas fa-envelope\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Ikon Indikator Keberhasilan di Sisi Kanan --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"icon is-small is-right\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"fas fa-check\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"help is-success\"</span>></span>Email ini tersedia dan valid.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-input-bergandeng-dengan-tombol-atau-awalan-has-addons\">3. Input Bergandeng dengan Tombol atau Awalan (<code>has-addons</code>)</h2>\n<p>Ketika Anda ingin menyatukan input teks dengan tombol pencarian, atau menyematkan awalan domain (prefix) tanpa celah pemisah, gunakan modifier <code>has-addons</code> pada pembungkus <code>.field</code>:</p>\n<h3 id=\"contoh-a-kotak-pencarian-terpadu\">Contoh A: Kotak Pencarian Terpadu</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field has-addons\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control is-expanded\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Cari dokumentasi atau modul...\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button is-primary\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"icon is-small\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"fas fa-search\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>Cari<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote class=\"callout callout-tip\">\n<p class=\"callout-title\">Utilitas</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"contoh-b-input-dengan-prefiks-statis\">Contoh B: Input dengan Prefiks Statis</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field has-addons\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button is-static\"</span>></span>https://<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control is-expanded\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"domain-pilihan-anda.com\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"4-dropdown-pemilihan-select-dan-area-teks-textarea\">4. Dropdown Pemilihan (<code>.select</code>) dan Area Teks (<code>.textarea</code>)</h2>\n<h3 id=\"dropdown-seleksi\">Dropdown Seleksi</h3>\n<p>Tag <code>&#x3C;select></code> harus dibungkus dalam wadah <code>&#x3C;div class=\"select\"></code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Pilih Paket Layanan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"select is-fullwidth\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>Pilih salah satu paket<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>Paket Dasar (Gratis)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>Paket Profesional (Bulanan)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>Paket Korporat (Tahunan)<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"area-teks-multibaris\">Area Teks Multibaris</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Catatan Tambahan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"textarea\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rows</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"3\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Tulis instruksi pengiriman khusus di sini...\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"5-kotak-centang-checkbox-dan-radio-button\">5. Kotak Centang (Checkbox) dan Radio Button</h2>\n<p>Bulma menata tag <code>&#x3C;label class=\"checkbox\"></code> dan <code>&#x3C;label class=\"radio\"></code> agar rapi dan sejajar:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkbox\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"checkbox\"</span>></span> Saya telah membaca dan menyetujui syarat &#x26; ketentuan layanan.\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string