r-horizontal-is-horizontal\">6. Formulir Horizontal (<code>is-horizontal</code>)</h2>\n<p>Untuk tata letak formulir klasik di mana label berada di sebelah kiri dan kotak input berada di sebelah kanan pada layar desktop:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field is-horizontal\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field-label is-normal\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"label\"</span>></span>Nama Organisasi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field-body\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"field\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"control\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"input\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Contoh: PT Teknologi Terbuka\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span